ta_path_creation_failure) which matches expectations and is not related to RPM filename handling. - After confirming the fix, I removed the ad-hoc OpenSUSE test file to keep the change surgical and avoid committing local validation tests. Acceptance criteria verification - For SUSE/OpenSUSE targets, distribution_filename(app) now yields name-version-revision.abi.rpm with no distro tag. - Fedora/RHEL behavior is unchanged; their filenames still include the distro tag. - The move step that uses distribution_filename(app) will now correctly find OpenSUSE RPMs. Notes - I kept changes narrowly scoped to distribution_filename(app). - I did not change rpm_tag or shared fixtures. - I validated with targeted tests first, then the full suite, and removed the temporary test file as requested. If you want, I can now prepare a commit for this change."
